@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. 基础模型调用
POST {{baseUrl}}/langchain/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "用一个 TypeScript 示例解释 RunnableSequence"
}

### 2. Runnable 并行处理
POST {{baseUrl}}/langchain/runnables
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "LangChain 的 Runnable 接口让模型、提示词、解析器和自定义函数拥有统一组合方式。"
}

### 3. 结构化输出
POST {{baseUrl}}/langchain/structured-output
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "生产环境登录后白屏，所有销售都无法工作，今天必须恢复。"
}

### 4. 添加知识
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "退款规则：商品发货前可自动退款；发货后需要客服审核；已完成超过七天不能退款。",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "refund-policy.md",
    "department": "support"
  }
}

### 5. RAG 问答
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "商品发货后能够直接退款吗？",
  "topK": 4
}

### 6. 工具型 Agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/order-assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "查询订单 A1001，并计算九折价格。",
  "currentUserId": "user-1"
}

### 7. LangGraph 条件路由
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphs/support-router
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "订单 A1001 已经发货，我想申请退款。",
  "threadId": "learning-thread-1"
}

### 8. 导出 Mermaid
GET {{baseUrl}}/graphs/support-router/mermaid
